<title>NIGERIA: Cooking gas explosion kills four in Nigeria.</title>
<headline>Cooking gas explosion kills four in Nigeria.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three children and a woman were killed when cooking gas cylinders exploded in the midwestern Nigerian town of Warri at the weekend, local newspapers reported on Monday.</p>
<p>They said the driver of a lorry delivering the cylinders was unaware of leaks from them and they exploded when he started his engine.</p>
